OL,3,GNEWSADolly Parton's niece wants to
OL,4,Alearn Welsh after singing with Bronwen
OL,5,ALewis
OL,6,
OL,7,FDolly Parton's niece wants to learn
OL,8,FWelsh after recording a Welsh language
OL,9,Fversion of one of her late aunt's most
OL,10,Ffamous songs, Jolene.
OL,12,FJada Star, a country singer from
OL,13,FTennessee, said: "I truly believe
OL,14,Fanyone can speak Welsh; it's such a
OL,15,Flovely feeling to speak the language,
OL,16,Fit's a comfortable language."
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
