OL,3,GNEWSADolly Parton's niece wants to
OL,4,Alearn Welsh after singing with Bronwen
OL,5,ALewis
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe track was recorded before Parton's
OL,8,Fdeath on 25 August and features vocals
OL,9,Ffrom the legendary singer-songwriter
OL,10,Fherself, who sings alongside Star and
OL,11,Fsinger Bronwen Lewis, from
OL,12,FBlaendeulais.
OL,14,FSince the songs release, Star has said
OL,15,Fshe would like to "roam every inch of
OL,16,FWales" and perhaps visit the Eisteddfod
OL,17,Fone day, as she enjoys learning more
OL,18,Fabout Wales and the Welsh language.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
